# Paper, code and results

The paper and the code and data released with it. Layout:

- `paper/` LaTeX sources of the paper (venue template, text, bibliography, checklist, appendix)
- `code/` simulation, estimators and analysis code
- `results/` per-cell result files behind every number in the paper
- `figures/`, `tables/` the figures and tables of the paper, with the script that makes each
- `REPRODUCE.md` environment, data, seeds, commands, run times, script per figure and table
